          "id": "L4-CLOUD-MOBILE-REAUTH-GATE",
          "level": "L4",
          "title": "移动 Cloud 重连鉴权完成后再恢复页面连接",
          "parent": "L3-REMOTE-INTERACTION-RELIABILITY",
          "codeTargets": [
